e-equivalence.mjs, review-check.mjs, any Worker request and any private path. 23 of 32 rows in ROUTE-AUTHORITY.md have no proof under this Worker. Every value in fresh-names.PENDING.json is null until the planner names it, so the packet refuses at load, and the qualifier must rerun over the filled names before assembly.\n\nThe landed worktree is clean at 112eff12. Main is at 074255e8, and no Worker has been deployed since 112eff12. A deployment before J4 closes voids this Source.","body":{"conditions":"Review the complete later-phases operator Source V12 at the stated digests, its diff from V11, and its actual qualification, rehearsal and control captures, for adoption. If you approve, file a report whose first text line holds Verdict: APPROVED and which holds the two full digest lines from this request, each exactly on its own line, with Architecture, Security and Simplification conclusions. This review adopts the operator only. It releases no phase, names no fresh value, and it is not J4 or S1 completion.","no_git_artifact":"true","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:01b584e86c14c66b2570a3bc9e66c09b302a3ade, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:2325d2bdec8bb369d6c3cd77d8163d178ccacc09 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:01e0dd696d953e8a4209c9e0a7461afc19c30b9a, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:043d587ef18b62fdeee6b57f8968de1567206697, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:070231aadcb17348891458bc2eedb5bbf529860c, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:171f5f57d26458ff1e85c1f9e0a69fefb342bc9b and 19 more","to":"4817b532e7a1a118634cb7947b05f7d5d16f726c9d30ea22ff7eaf7db3634e80"}}